    "text": "The locus of the midpoint of the chords of the hyperbola <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>25</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>36</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> which passes through the point <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is a hyperbola, whose transverse axis length (in units) is equal to",
